Honeywood — licensing overview

This project contains three kinds of material, licensed differently.

1. CODE: MIT License (below)
   Everything in this project EXCEPT the artwork in part 2 and the licence
   documents in part 3, including:
     - the colour theme definitions and colour palette:
         themes/*.json, src/palette.mjs, src/workbench.mjs, src/syntax.mjs
     - the icon theme mapping file and its source:
         icons/honeywood-icon-theme.json, src/icon-map.mjs
     - package.json and package-lock.json
     - the build, test, preview and packaging scripts in scripts/,
       EXCEPT scripts/design/
     - test fixtures in fixtures/
     - the documentation text: README.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/
     - project configuration: .vscode/, .gitignore, .vscodeignore

2. ARTWORK: all rights reserved, with the permissions in ARTWORK-LICENSE.md
     - icons/svg/, icons/batches/, icons/proposals/
     - images/ (the Marketplace icon and the README screenshots)
     - preview/marketplace-icon/
     - scripts/design/ (the drawing scripts that contain and generate the
       icon artwork)
   The artwork is NOT licensed under the MIT License.

3. LICENCE DOCUMENTS: this file (LICENSE) and ARTWORK-LICENSE.md
   These documents set out the terms above. They are not part of the code or
   the artwork. You may copy and redistribute them as needed to accompany
   this project, a fork of it or the official extension package, and to
   explain its terms. In particular:
     - When you reuse the MIT-licensed code, you may reproduce the copyright
       notice and MIT License text below on their own, as the MIT License
       requires, without the rest of this file.
     - If you remove all of the artwork from a copy or derivative of this
       project, you may adapt this overview to describe what that copy
       contains. Keep the copyright notice and MIT License text below
       unchanged.
     - While a copy still contains any of the artwork, keep
       ARTWORK-LICENSE.md with it, unmodified.
   Copying or redistributing these documents does not grant any permission
   to copy, modify or reuse the artwork beyond what ARTWORK-LICENSE.md
   allows.

